Sligo Geology Viewer

This repository contains source code for a static geological model viewer and
selected generated/demo data payloads.

Data attribution:
- Geological, groundwater, geothermal, karst, borehole, and related spatial
  context may derive from public Irish geoscience and environmental sources,
  including Geological Survey Ireland and other public agencies.
- Basemap/satellite imagery is loaded from third-party public tile services at
  runtime where available and is not redistributed in this repository.

The model is an interpretation for screening and demonstration purposes. It is
not a certified engineering, drilling, hydrogeological, or planning assessment.

If you publish derived work, review and retain the attribution and license terms
for any upstream datasets you add or redistribute.
